      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"We Found Love\" is a song recorded by Barbadian singer Rihanna from her sixth studio album, \"Talk That Talk\" (2011). It was written and produced by, and features Scottish DJ Calvin Harris; the song was also featured on his third album \"18 Months\" (2012). \"We Found Love\" premiered on September 22, 2011, on the Capital FM radio station in the United Kingdom, and was made available to download on the same day as the lead single from \"Talk That Talk\". \"We Found Love\" is an uptempo electro house song, with elements of techno and Europop. The song's lyrics speak of a couple who \"found love in a hopeless place\".",
